{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Compiler/LCNF/WithPtrEq.html#Lean.Compiler.LCNF.checkWithPtrEqType\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Compiler</span>.<span class=\"name\">LCNF</span>.<span class=\"name\">checkWithPtrEqType</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">type</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Checks that pointer equality implies equality for values of `type`, which is required for\ncompiling `withPtrEq` at `type`, and throws an error otherwise. See the module docstring for\ndetails.","docLink":"./Lean/Compiler/LCNF/WithPtrEq.html#Lean.Compiler.LCNF.checkWithPtrEqType","kind":"def","line":130,"name":"Lean.Compiler.LCNF.checkWithPtrEqType","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Compiler/LCNF/WithPtrEq.lean#L130-L137"}}],"imports":["Lean.Meta.Basic","Lean.Meta.InferType","Lean.Meta.WHNF"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Compiler.LCNF.WithPtrEq"}